  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the broiler to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together pineapple, peaches, banana, and grapes.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together butter, honey, and lemon juice.",
    "Brush the mixture onto the fruit mix.",
    "Thread the fruit mix onto the wooden skewers.",
    "Place the brochette under the broiler for 5 minutes.",
    "Turn the brochette and broil for another 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the brochette from the oven and let it cool for 2 minutes.",
    "Serve the uruguayan fruit mix brochette warm."
